WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,190
Boss

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,040
The Chen family has three heavy-duty snow transport vehicles today

3
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,280
Transit from northwest

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,440
The car is covered with a tarp

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,960
The people who pressed the car were all black-painted elites.

6
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,880
The route also took three twists and turns.

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,040
Interesting

8
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,480
three times winding

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,360
The end point is just the same underground river ice crack zone

10
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:27,380
This is the Chen family's secret transportation line. Listen.

11
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,860
This ice sheet has been completely blocked by my black paint

12
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,660
This is the Chen family’s iron defense line

13
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,460
Don't even think about flying into the warehouse seal.

14
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,140
Who dares to touch the Chen family’s things?

15
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:39,270
I'll tear his bones apart one by one and feed them to the dogs.

16
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:43,760
A bit interesting to get started

17
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,180
Order confirmation

18
00:00:47,340 --> 00:01:00,020
clear goals

19
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,180
All the supplies have been brought up

20
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:02,780
No trace left

21
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:13,800
No. 03 is still searching for the owner of the leftover supplies.

22
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,160
Unusual items found
